     1201         ub.price-doc-forming-gds.pdf-id      = p-pdf-id
     1202       .
     1203   end.
     1204   for each buf_pd-forming-gds-attr no-lock where
     1205            buf_pd-forming-gds-attr.pdf-db      = buf_price-doc-forming.pdf-db       and
     1206            buf_pd-forming-gds-attr.pdf-id      = buf_price-doc-forming.pdf-id       and
